1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,890
What is F S L?

2
00:00:01,890 --> 00:00:07,938
Meet the collection of tools used to inspect, preprocess, model, and report M R I data.

3
00:00:07,938 --> 00:00:13,608
The goal is clear: Describe F S L as a suite rather than one application.

4
00:00:14,458 --> 00:00:18,198
F S L is a toolkit, not a single program.

5
00:00:18,198 --> 00:00:26,799
F S L—the F M R I B Software Library—is a collection of command-line tools and graphical interfaces for M R I analysis.

6
00:00:26,799 --> 00:00:39,514
FEAT handles functional M R I modeling, F S L Eyes displays images, and utilities such as F S L info, F S L stats, and F S L maths inspect or transform data.

7
00:00:39,514 --> 00:00:41,758
A typical workflow moves between tools.

8
00:00:41,758 --> 00:00:53,725
You might inspect a raw bold image in F S L Eyes, configure a model in FEAT, run it, then return to F S L Eyes to check registration and statistical maps.

9
00:00:53,725 --> 00:01:00,831
Learning F S L therefore means learning both the scientific purpose of each step and the output it produces.

10
00:01:01,681 --> 00:01:04,711
Now connect the idea to an observable check.

11
00:01:04,711 --> 00:01:07,362
First, open Neurodesk in a second window.

12
00:01:07,362 --> 00:01:10,393
Next, locate the F S L application tile.

13
00:01:10,393 --> 00:01:16,074
Then, open an F S L terminal and identify the version shown in the prompt.

14
00:01:16,074 --> 00:01:19,105
The command shown on screen is an example.

15
00:01:19,105 --> 00:01:24,786
Adapt its path to your own working directory and verify the target before running it.

16
00:01:25,636 --> 00:01:26,664
Educational scope.

17
00:01:26,664 --> 00:01:29,234
These lessons teach transferable workflows.

18
00:01:29,234 --> 00:01:35,915
Always follow the preprocessing and statistical protocol approved for your project or institution.

19
00:01:35,915 --> 00:01:46,194
A useful self-check is this: Why do we move between FEAT, F S L Eyes, and F S L utilities?

20
00:01:46,194 --> 00:01:52,876
They serve different roles: model configuration, visual inspection, and command-line measurement or transformation.

21
00:01:53,726 --> 00:01:59,722
To recap: First, F S L is a suite of related neuroimaging tools.

22
00:01:59,722 --> 00:02:03,412
Next, successful computation never replaces visual quality control.

23
00:02:03,412 --> 00:02:12,638
Before continuing, make sure you can explain this objective: Describe F S L as a suite rather than one application.
